   "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n## Copilot review overview\n\n### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe behavior matches the transport capabilities and has focused regression coverage; the remaining comment-style issue is non-blocking.\n\n**Review effort:** Balanced  \n**Findings:** 1 <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Low severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture>\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>Open (1)</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Low severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Condense method-body comment to one line](#discussion_r4101090106) · New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nScopes Claude WebSearch blocking to Copilot-proxy sessions while preserving it for native Anthropic sessions.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Applies `disallowedTools` only to proxy transport.\n- Adds proxy/native regression tests.\n- Updates roadmap documentation.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `claudeSdkOptions.ts` | Makes WebSearch blocking transport-specific. |\r\n| `claudeSdkOptions.test.ts` | Tests proxy and native behavior. |\r\n| `roadmap.md` | Documents the transport distinction. |\n</detail