   "body": "@TylerLeonhardt since you wrote the native transport (#323037): the WebSearch block's documented reason in `roadmap.md` is that CAPI doesn't support the tool, so this limits `disallowedTools: ['WebSearch']` to the proxy transport and leaves native sessions able to search. Happy to adjust if there's another reason to keep it on for native.",
