   "updated_at": "2026-10-08T15:14:09Z",
   "body": "@TylerLeonhardt friendly ping. This is a one-line change in `claudeSdkOptions.ts` that keeps `WebSearch` available on the native (BYO-Anthropic) transport. It fixes #337886. Copilot's review comment is addressed, and the branch still matches `main` in that spot.\n\nI also checked it at runtime: with SDK 0.3.281 on native subscription auth and `WebSearch` not disallowed, the tool returns results and the turn ends with `success`. The proxy transport keeps `disallowedTools: ['WebSearch']`, and a unit test covers each transport. Happy to adjust if you'd prefer a different approach.",
   "author_association": "NONE",
