    "message": "Claude agent host: keep WebSearch available on the native transport\n\nThe WebSearch block exists because CAPI does not support the tool, which\nonly applies when the SDK is routed through the Copilot proxy. Native\n(Anthropic-auth) sessions talk to Anthropic directly, where WebSearch\nworks, so only disallow it for the proxy transport.\n\nFixes #337886",
